<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title><%= calendar.name %> – Kalender</title>

    <!-- ✅ Direkt eingebettetes CSS -->
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            color: #333;
            padding: 2rem;
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        h1, h2 {
            color: #222;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        form {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        input[type="text"],
        input[type="date"],
        select {
            padding: 0.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 400px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        button {
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            background-color: #0066cc;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        button:hover {
            background-color: #004999;
        }

        .calendar-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr);
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .day-cell {
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            padding: 8px;
            min-height: 100px;
            background-color: #fff;
            border-radius: 5px;
            vertical-align: top;
        }

        .day-cell strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .event {
            background-color: #e6f7ff;
            padding: 4px 6px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-top: 4px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        em {
            color: #aaa;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
<h1><%= calendar.name %></h1>
<p>Dies ist dein geteiltes Kalenderblatt für <strong><%= monthName %></strong>. Du kannst Termine hinzufügen, löschen oder zwischen Monaten wechseln.</p>

<p><strong>Besitzer:</strong> <%= owner.name %></p>
<% if (sharedWith.length > 0) { %>
    <p><strong>Geteilt mit:</strong> <%= sharedWith.map(u => u.name).join(', ') %></p>
<% } else { %>
    <p><em>Privater Kalender</em></p>
<% } %>

<!-- Monatsauswahl -->
<h2>Monat wechseln</h2>
<form method="GET" action="">
    <label for="month">Monat:</label>
    <select name="month" id="month">
        <% for (let m = 1; m <= 12; m++) { %>
            <option value="<%= m %>" <%= m === month ? "selected" : "" %>>
                <%= new Date(0, m - 1).toLocaleString('de-DE', { month: 'long' }) %>
            </option>
        <% } %>
    </select>

    <label for="year">Jahr:</label>
    <select name="year" id="year">
        <% for (let y = year - 3; y <= year + 3; y++) { %>
            <option value="<%= y %>" <%= y === year ? "selected" : "" %>><%= y %></option>
        <% } %>
    </select>

    <button type="submit">📅 Anzeigen</button>
</form>

<!-- Monatsraster -->
<h2><%= monthName %></h2>
<div class="calendar-grid">
    <% days.forEach(day => { %>
        <div class="day-cell">
            <strong><%= new Date(day.date).getDate() %>.</strong>
            <% if (day.events.length > 0) { %>
                <% day.events.forEach(event => { %>
                    <div class="event"><%= event.title %></div>
                <% }) %>
            <% } else { %>
                <em>–</em>
            <% } %>
        </div>
    <% }) %>
</div>

<!-- Termin hinzufügen -->
<h2>Neuen Termin hinzufügen</h2>
<form action="/calendar/<%= owner.id %>/<%= calendar.id %>/add-event" method="POST">
    <input type="date" name="date" required>
    <input type="text" name="title" placeholder="Was steht an?" required>
    <button type="submit">+ Termin hinzufügen</button>
</form>

<br>
<a href="/my-calendars/<%= owner.id %>">
    <button>← Zurück zur Kalenderübersicht</button>
</a>
</body>
</html>
